&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/3f635bf03b394ebbb474e70d42fb6601/reader/6" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;#6 繁殖池与触手弥漫的群岛#4 End Of Chapter&lt;/a&gt;
